      "id": "claim_e3fb9113f3f349f1a653126d01552b26",
      "statement": "A History row becomes a labeled eval case only if matchType is not 'NON-ITEM', it links to a resolvable Premier or 3rd Party catalog record (whose Item ID becomes the label), its Original Spec is at least 3 characters and not a pasted URL, and its project is not in QUARANTINED_PROJECTS.",
