      "id": "claim_c553661f87554181b7a149dec2cf26d6",
      "statement": "Within runEval, cases are grouped and processed per project fold; for each fold the harness relearns the series-to-category map from that fold's own LOPO-filtered history via learnSeriesCategories/toSeriesCategoryMap and installs it with setActiveSeriesCategoryMap for the duration of that fold, resetting it to null after all folds complete.",
